Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:28.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西利亚斯法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Kaecilius.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个法事只会让你懊悔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ritual will bring you only sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.82,0:03:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虚伪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑战关卡 比利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Challenge round, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 比利 开玩笑呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Billy. You've got to be messing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.93,0:05:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歌曲《如此美好》 恰克·曼吉欧尼 1977年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels So Good, Chuck Mangione, 1977.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 比利 你还说这个会很难呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, Billy, you said this one would be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是1978年 - 不 比利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's 1978. - No, Billy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歌曲《如此美好》虽然是1978年登上榜单的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while Feels So Good may have charted in 1978,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但专辑是1977年12月发行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the album was released in December, 1977.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.21,0:05:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 维基上说是197... - 再看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no. Wikipedia says it's a 19... - Check again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些无用的信息你都储存在哪啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you store all this useless information?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无用 他单靠粗管短号就能上前十热曲榜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Useless? The man charted a top ten hit with a Flugelhorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 比利 - 1977年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Status, Billy? - 1977.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 我恨你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"如此美好" 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Feels so good", doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:50.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来吧 斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I've got this, Stephen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该做的做完了 去吧 我们来缝合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done your bit. Go ahead, we'll close up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.51,0:05:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 枪伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - GSW.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然还能保住他的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's amazing you kept him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:05:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼吸暂停 脑干测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apneic, failed the brain stem test...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:01.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和呼吸暂停反射测试均无反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the apnea reflex test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像发现问题所在了 帕尔默医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I found the problem, Dr. Palmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把一颗子弹留在了他的脑子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You left a bullet in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 它撞到了髓质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. It's impinging on the medulla.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要专家意见 尼克已经判了脑死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed a specialist. Nic diagnose brain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我就是觉得不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something about that doesn't feel right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:16.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韦斯特医生 你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. West! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,器官采集 他是捐献者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Organ harvest. He's a donor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别急 我可没同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down. I did not agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要你同意 我们已经判定脑死亡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need you to. We've already called brain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.18,0:06:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说早了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prematurely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得为他准备进行枕下开颅手术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get him prepped for sub-occipital craniotomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你给死人开刀的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not gonna let you operate on a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一颗子弹 - 一颗完好的子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A bullet? - A perfect bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹加固过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been hardened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹加固是用铅锑合金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You harden a bullet by alloying lead with antimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有毒金属{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A toxic metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且子弹直接接触脑脊液{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's leeched directly into the cerebral spinal fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻造成中枢神经系统停摆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rapid-onset central nervous system shutdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,病人没死 但他要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The patient's not dead, but he's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要采集他的器官吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still want to harvest his organs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来协助你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用 帕尔默医生会协助我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Dr. Palmer will assist me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影像引导 立刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Image guidance, stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没那个时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:16.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能直接用手做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do it freehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能 我就要这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是炫耀的时候 斯特兰奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a time for showing off, Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那十分钟前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about ten minutes ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错判了死亡时间时呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you called the wrong time of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,颅神经未受损{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cranial nerves intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韦斯特医生 盖住你的表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. West, cover your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没必要当着众人的面羞辱他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you didn't have to humiliate him in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没必要救他的病人呢 但是嘛...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have to save his patient, either. But, you know, I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有时候就是忍不住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes just can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 尼克是个好医生 - 你来找我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nic is a great doctor. - You came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.11,0:08:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想听听别人的意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I needed a second opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a second opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.91,0:08:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想听到好的意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you needed was a competent one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你更该当我的待命神经外科医生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, all the more reason why you should be my neurosurgeon on call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:02.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以做出很大贡献{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could make such a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能在你的屠宰场工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't work in your butcher shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在做截断脊髓熔合术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm fusing transected spinal cords.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及刺激中枢神经的神经发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm stimulating neurogenesis in the central nervous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的工作在今后的年月里能拯救上千人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The work I'm doing is gonna save thousands for years to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而在急诊室 至多就是救拿枪的笨蛋醉鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In ER, you get to save one drunk idiot with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我们急诊室的人不过就是在救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you're right. In ER, we're only saving lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:19.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捞不到名声 没有CNN来采访{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no fame, there's no CNN interviews...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我只能继续用尼克了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess I'll have to stick with Nic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.65,0:09:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 你们不是...你俩没...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wait a minute. You're not... you guys aren't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上床吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleeping together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我以为我厌恶的口气能暗示我的意思了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I thought that was implicit in my disgust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实非常明显{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explicit, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 我有绝对不能跟同事约会的规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no, I have a very strict rule against dating colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 我称之为"斯特兰奇准则"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh really? - I call it the Strange policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 很高兴有东西是以我命名的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good! I'm glad something's named after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发明了一种椎板切除术手术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I invented a laminectomy procedure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不知为何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet, somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎没人愿意管它叫"斯特兰奇术"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one seems to want to call it the Strange technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们一起发明了那个术式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We invented that technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你的准则让我受宠若惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, regardless, I'm very flattered by your policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今晚要去参加个神经病学协会的晚宴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking tonight at a Neurological Society dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是去演讲 真浪漫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another speaking engagement? So romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:09:58.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前可喜欢跟我去参加这类活动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to love coming to those things with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们很开心的 - 不 是你很开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We had fun together. - No. You've had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是以我们为主 是以你为主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't about us, they were about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不仅仅是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯蒂芬 什么事都是以你为中心的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stephen. Everything is about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许可以用连字符{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we could hyphenate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇-帕尔默术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange-Palmer technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕尔默-斯特兰奇术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Palmer-Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利 都有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy! What have you got for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.01,0:11:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,35岁的空军上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a 35-year-old Air Force colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿实验性装甲压碎了下脊柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crushed his lower spine in some kind of experimental armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中胸廓爆裂骨折{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mid-thoracic burst fracture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我是可以帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I could help,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还有50个人也能帮他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but so could 50 other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我找点值得做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find me something worth my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,68岁女士 晚期脑干胶质细胞瘤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a 68-year-old female with an advanced brain stem glioma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是想让我破坏我的完美记录吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you want me to screw up my perfect record?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22岁女性 脑内有电子植入物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a 22-year-old female with an electronic implant in her brain
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:30.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以控制精神分裂症 却被闪电击中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to control schizophrenia struck by lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个听上去是很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That does sound interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能发给我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you send me the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.99,0:12:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们用直升机送你过来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They rushed you in a chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但找到你费了不少时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it took a little while to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在车里时 修复神经损伤的黄金时期就过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The golden hours for nerve damage went by while you were in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,11根不锈钢针插入骨头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11 stainless steel pins in the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多处韧带撕裂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Multiple torn ligaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双手严重神经损伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Severe nerve damage in both hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在手术台上躺了11个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were on the table for 11 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这些固定器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at these fixators.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人能做得更好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one could have done better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就能做得更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have done better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你的身体点时间愈合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give your body time to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你毁了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've ruined me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要多久才能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long until I can tak...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇医生 你的组织还在愈合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Strange... those tissues are still healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就加快速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So speed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把支架沿肱动脉伸入桡动脉下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass a stent down the brachial artery into the radial artery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能可行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是昂贵的实验性疗法 但有可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Experimental and expensive, but possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能就行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I need is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:04.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出点力气来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根本没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是没用的 你可以的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not useless, man, you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那回答我 学士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, answer me this, bachelor's degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过谁遭受了这么严重的神经损伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever known anyone with nerve damage this severe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过理疗 康复了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to do this, and actually recover?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One guy, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工厂事故 脊椎断了 瘫痪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Factory accident, broke his back. Paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的腿日渐萎缩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His leg wasted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:33.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为推轮椅 他肩膀疼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had pain in his shoulder from the wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一周来三次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came in 3 times a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一天 突然不来了 我以为他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then one day stopped coming. I thought he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几年后 他在街上从我身边走过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few years later, he walked past me on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走 - 对 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Walked? - Yeah, walked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:45.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扯淡 拿他的病例给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit. Show me his file.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从档案馆里找到他的病例得要点时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll take me a while to pull the files from the archive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果能证明你个自大鬼错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it proves your arrogant ass wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也值了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看过了你所有的研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I looked at all your research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,读了你发来的所有论文 这是行不通的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read all the papers you've sent, it's no gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你并不明白 你伤得多重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I don't think you realize how severe the damages are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:19.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是这样的 - 最优秀的医生都没能做到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, here's the thing, I... - The best have tried and failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我理解 是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I understand. Here's the thing. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我做的事根本不可能 斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you want from me is impossible, Stephen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我还得考虑自己的名声 - 拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've got my own reputation to consider. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃蒂安 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Etienne, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:30.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没法帮你 - 等等 别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't help you... - Wait. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不肯做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:50.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个庸医{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东京有种新手术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a new procedure in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们培养捐献者的干细胞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They culture donor stem cells and then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行采集 然后3D打印个支架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}harvesting them and 3D-printing a scaffold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能借到钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could get a loan together, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯蒂芬 斯蒂芬 - 一小笔 20万{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stephen... Stephen. - A small loan, 200,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直是挣多少花多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've always spent money as fast as you could make it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你现在是在花你没有的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but now you're spending money you don't even have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许该考虑停止了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's time to consider stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:11.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 现在才更不能停止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Now is exactly the time not to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 我并没有好转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, you see, I'm not getting any better!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这已经不是求医了 这是发疯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this isn't medicine anymore. This is mania.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:20.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些东西就是治不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some things just can't be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有工作的生活 - 也还是生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Life without my work... - Is still life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:25.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是末路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有其他事能让你的生命富有意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are other things that can give your life meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what? Like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在该道歉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is the part where you apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the part where you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我也看不下去你再这么折磨自己了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. I can't watch you do this to yourself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太艰难了 是吗 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Too difficult for you, is it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到你这样令我心碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It breaks my heart to see you this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 别可怜我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Don't pity me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在可怜你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not pitying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 那你为什么来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah? Then what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带奶酪和酒来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bringing cheese and wine
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像我们是去吃野餐的老朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like we're old friends going for a picnic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:53.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是朋友 克里斯汀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not friends, Christine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们连情人都算不上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were barely lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就喜欢悲剧故事 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you just love a sob story, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在就这么看我了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what I am to you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的斯蒂芬·斯特兰奇 施舍对象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Stephen Strange, charity case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他终于需要我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He finally needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一个你可以拯救的人性渣滓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another dreg of humanity for you to work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他包扎好 让他重新回归社会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patch him up and send him back into the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.38,0:18:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心里简直要唱起歌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hearts just humming...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你非常在乎 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You care so much! Don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Stephen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:28.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(斯蒂芬·斯特兰奇)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(我说的吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(乔·潘伯恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 拿出点真本事来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man! Where is the competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你话真多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳森·潘伯恩 C7-C8脊椎完全性损伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan Pangborn, C7-C8 spinal cord injury, complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 胸部以下瘫痪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Paralyzed from the mid-chest down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双手部分瘫痪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Partial paralysis in both hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是斯蒂芬·斯特兰奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Stephen Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个神经外科医生 曾经是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a neurosurgeon. Was a neurosurgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我还真认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, you know what, man? I do know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经去过你办公室 你拒绝见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to your office once. You refused to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我连你助理那关都没过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never got past your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时没法医治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were untreatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,治不好就得不到荣誉 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No glory for you in that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从万劫不复的病情中康复了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came back from a place there's no way back from!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想找到我的康复之路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to find my own way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.81,0:20:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潘伯恩 你还打不打了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pangborn, are you in or you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来都放弃我的身体了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd given up on my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为我只剩下思维了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought my mind's the only thing I had left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:21.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少也该努力提升它一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should at least try to elevate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我去见大师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I sat with gurus,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有圣女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sacred women.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陌生人抬着我上山顶去见圣人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strangers carried me to mountain tops to see holy men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终 我找到了我的导师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And finally, I found my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的思维得到了提升{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my mind was elevated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.39,0:20:37.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灵魂得到了深化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my spirit deepened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不知如何 - 你的身体痊愈了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And somehow... - Your body healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:44.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有更深奥的秘密等着我学习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there were deeper secrets to learn there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我没有体力去接受了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I didn't have the strength to receive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.63,0:20:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我安于我的奇迹 回家来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I chose to settle for my miracle, and I came back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找的地方叫卡马塔奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The place you're looking for is called Kamar-Taj.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:21:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但那里代价很高 - 多少钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But the cost there is high. - How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:02.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我指的不是钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not talking about money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:11.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩球吧 来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's ball. All right, ball up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(尼泊尔 加德满都)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 打扰一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡马塔奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kamar-Taj?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道卡马塔奇在哪吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where Kamar-Taj is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(找到安宁 找到自己)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡马塔奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kamar-Taj?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡马塔奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kamar-Taj...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.29,0:22:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.91,0:22:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们 我没有钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look guys, I... I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.01,0:22:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的手表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 求你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我只剩这个了 - 你的手表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all I have left. - Your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.43,0:23:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在找卡马塔奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking for Kamar-Taj?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:02.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.36,0:24:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定找对地方了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you got the right place?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.12,0:24:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里看起来更...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one looks a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.14,0:24:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡马塔奇一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kamar-Taj.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经和你一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I once stood in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.84,0:24:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也曾经...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I, too, was...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.71,0:24:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你点建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So might I offer you some advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.94,0:24:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘掉你自以为知道的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget everything you think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.77,0:24:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.63,0:24:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这圣殿属于我们的导师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sanctuary of our teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.27,0:24:42.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古一法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ancient One.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.86,0:24:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古一法师 他真名叫什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ancient One? What's his real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.34,0:24:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 忘掉我自以为知道的一切 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Forget everything I think I know. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.01,0:25:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.71,0:25:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 这是...规矩吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's, uh... a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.70,0:25:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.40,0:25:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.87,0:25:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.62,0:25:20.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢你 古一法师 愿意见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, thank you, Ancient One... for... seeing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.56,0:25:21.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.33,0:25:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 古一法师 - 谢谢 莫多法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Ancient One. - Thank you, Master Mordo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.45,0:25:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 哈密尔法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Master Hamir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.53,0:25:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.55,0:25:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定不再是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no. Not anymore, surely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.28,0:25:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不正是因此而来的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that why you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.96,0:25:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了许多次手术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've undergone many procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.79,0:25:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 七次 对吧 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seven, right? - Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.04,0:25:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好茶 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good tea. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.35,0:25:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是治好了一个叫潘伯恩的人 他瘫痪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you heal a man named Pangborn? A paralyzed man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.56,0:25:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.94,0:25:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帮了他 他又能走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You helped him to walk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.24,0:25:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.02,0:26:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么治好C7-C8脊椎完全性损伤的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you correct a complete C7-C8 spinal cord injury?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是治好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't correct it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.82,0:26:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能走 我让他相信他能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't walk; I convinced him that he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是指身心治疗吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not suggesting it was psychosomatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.62,0:26:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把断掉的神经接好后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you reattach a severed nerve,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.67,0:26:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你 还是身体让它痊愈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it you who heals it back together or the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.33,0:26:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是细胞 - 而细胞被设定好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's the cells. - And the cells are only programmed
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.73,0:26:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以特定的方式来痊愈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to put themselves back together in very specific ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你 你可以说服身体相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I told you that your own body could be convinced
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.96,0:26:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它能以各种各样的方式痊愈呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to put itself back together in all sorts of ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说细胞再生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking about cellular regeneration.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.20,0:26:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种技术非常尖端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's... bleeding-edge medical tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.10,0:26:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才在这里工作吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why you're working here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.31,0:26:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脱离医院董事会的监管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without a governing medical board? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.77,0:26:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的治疗方法实验性多强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just how experimental is your treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.06,0:26:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.97,0:26:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你有办法让神经细胞重组自愈吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you've figured out a way to reprogram nerve cells to self-heal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 斯特兰奇先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Mr. Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.03,0:26:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道如何调整精神力量 使身体更好地愈合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to reorient the spirit to better heal the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.15,0:26:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精神力量...愈合身体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spirit... to heal the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.80,0:26:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.29,0:27:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Al... Al... All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.06,0:27:05.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要怎么做 从哪开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we do that? Where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.34,0:27:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喜欢那张图吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't like that map?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.43,0:27:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 它真的很不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. It's... it's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.95,0:27:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是...我以前见过这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just... you know, I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在礼品店里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In gift shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.54,0:27:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这张呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 针灸 厉害 - 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Acupuncture, great. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.93,0:27:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那张怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about... that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.61,0:27:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在给我看核磁共振图吗 难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showing me an MRI scan? I do not believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画每张图的人 都只能窥视局部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each of those maps was drawn up by someone who could see in part,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.86,0:27:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而看不到全局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not the whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.03,0:27:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为来这儿 花了最后的一点钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent my last dollar getting here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.94,0:27:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买了张单程票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one-way ticket,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.61,0:27:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却在跟我说信仰治疗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're talking to me about healing through belief?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.05,0:27:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是一个通过钥匙孔窥视世界的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a man looking at the world through a keyhole,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.55,0:27:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这一生 都在试图扩大那个钥匙孔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've spent your whole life trying to widen that keyhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.55,0:27:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想看到更多 知道更多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To see more, to know more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.47,0:27:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而如今听闻 这钥匙孔可以扩大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, on hearing that it can be widen
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.55,0:27:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是以你无法想象的方式 你却抗拒这个可能性吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in ways you can't imagine, you reject the possibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.79,0:27:57.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我拒绝是因为我不信天方夜谭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I reject it because I do not believe in fairy tales
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.48,0:28:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么脉轮 能量 信仰的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about chakras, or energy, or the power of belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.02,0:28:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本没有精神力量这东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no such thing as spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.02,0:28:07.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都由物质构成 别无他物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are made of matter, and nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.12,0:28:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是一粒小小的 转瞬即逝的尘埃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just another tiny, momentary speck
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.91,0:28:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂浮在这冷漠的世界里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}within an indifferent universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.73,0:28:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太妄自菲薄了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think too little of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.04,0:28:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自以为能看穿我 是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you see through me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.20,0:28:16.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才不能呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.89,0:28:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是看穿你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I see through you!!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.48,0:28:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚对我做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you just do to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.75,0:28:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将你的魂体打出了你的肉体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pushed your astral form out of your physical form.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.05,0:28:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那杯茶里加了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in that tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.87,0:28:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裸头草碱 还是迷幻剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psilocybin? LSD?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.71,0:28:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.58,0:28:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加了一点蜂蜜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a little honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.26,0:28:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.25,0:28:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一瞬间 你进入了精神次元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a moment, you entered the astral dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.37,0:28:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 魂魄与躯壳不共生的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The what? - A place where the soul exists apart from the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.13,0:28:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样对我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.04,0:29:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让你明白你有多无知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To show you just how much you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.63,0:29:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睁开你的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.16,0:29:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.19,0:29:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh god! Oh god!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.99,0:29:14.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No. No. No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.17,0:29:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.27,0:29:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是真的 不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't real. This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.26,0:29:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是真的 这是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't real. This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.33,0:29:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh god!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.18,0:29:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No. No. No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.07,0:29:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的心率太高 有点危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His heart rate is getting dangerously high.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.56,0:29:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看他挺好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks all right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.05,0:29:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自以为明白这世界如何运转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you know how the world works?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.04,0:29:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为这物质宇宙就是全部了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think that this material universe is all there is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.10,0:29:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何为真实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is real?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:58.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你感官无法触及之处 还有怎样的奥秘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What mysteries lie beyond the reach of your senses?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.40,0:30:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在万物存在的根源处 思维与物质交合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the root of existence, mind and matter meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.92,0:30:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,思维塑造现实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thoughts shape reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.73,0:30:25.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个宇宙不过无数个宇宙之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This universe is only one of an infinite number.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.84,0:30:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无尽的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worlds without end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.64,0:30:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些世界充满仁爱与生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some benevolent and life-giving;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.93,0:30:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些则满是恶念与饥荒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others filled with malice and hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.35,0:30:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有黑暗之地 存在着比时间更古老的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dark places, where powers older than time lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.05,0:30:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贪婪地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ravenous...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.06,0:30:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等待着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.15,0:31:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在浩瀚的多元宇宙间 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you in this vast multiverse,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.06,0:31:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.34,0:31:27.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在礼品店见过这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen that before in a gift shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.45,0:31:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教教我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teach me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.50,0:31:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.14,0:31:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.46,0:31:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.37,0:31:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不不 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no no no no!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.73,0:31:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 开门 求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Open the door! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.49,0:32:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 各位法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.75,0:32:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我不该赶他走吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I was wrong to cast him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.28,0:32:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五小时了 他还在你门口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}5 hours later, he's still on your doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.85,0:32:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他身上有股力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a strength to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.52,0:32:18.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顽固 自负 野心...我都见过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stubbornness, arrogance, ambition... I've seen it all before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.92,0:32:20.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让你想起了卡西利亚斯吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He reminds you of Kaecilius?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.11,0:32:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能再教另一个天赋异禀的学生学会强大法术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot lead another gifted student to power,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再看着他被黑暗吞噬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only to lose him to the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.49,0:32:29.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就没有那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't lose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.69,0:32:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想获得力量 打败敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted the power to defeat my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.63,0:32:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给了我力量打败心魔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me the power to defeat my demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.47,0:32:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并遵守自然法则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to live within the natural law.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.56,0:32:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们永远不能摆脱心魔 莫多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never lose our demons, Mordo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.77,0:32:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能学会抑制它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only learn to live above them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.38,0:32:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被偷的几页书还在卡西利亚斯手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaecilius still has the stolen pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.51,0:32:53.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他成功破解 就能毁灭我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he deciphers them, he could bring ruin upon us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.30,0:32:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗的日子可能就要到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There may be dark days ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.70,0:33:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡马塔奇或许用得上斯特兰奇这样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps Kamar-Taj could use a man like Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.82,0:33:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别把我挡在外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shut me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.35,0:33:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没别的地方可去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't got anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.72,0:33:23.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.95,0:33:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗澡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.10,0:33:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.26,0:33:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是冥想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meditate...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你可以的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.85,0:33:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古一法师会派人来找你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ancient One will send for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.10,0:33:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么 我的咒语吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this? My mantra?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.58,0:33:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是无线网密码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Wi-Fi password.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.52,0:33:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们又不是野蛮人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.86,0:34:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(时间会表明 我爱你多深 克里斯汀)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.00,0:34:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法的语言和人类文明一样古老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The language of the mystic arts is as old as civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.08,0:34:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古代的法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sorcerers of antiquity
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.34,0:34:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这种语言的使用称为"咒语"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called the use of this language "Spells".
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.39,0:34:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果这个词有违你的现代思维{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if that word offends your modern sensibilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.52,0:34:41.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以把它称作"程序"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can call it a "Program".
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.45,0:34:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是塑造了现实的源代码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The source code that shapes reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.74,0:34:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们汲取能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We harness energy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.35,0:34:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自多元宇宙其他次元的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drawn from other dimensions of the multiverse,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.87,0:34:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来施咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to cast spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.27,0:34:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变出护盾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to conjure shields
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.07,0:35:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创造魔法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.74,0:35:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.04,0:35:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我的手指可以做到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if my fingers could do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.05,0:35:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手也只是在胡乱挥舞而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my hands would just be waving in the air. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.11,0:35:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么才能达到你那种程度呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how do I get from here to there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.50,0:35:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你是如何能连接断裂的神经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get to reattach severed nerves, and
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.01,0:35:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一节一节地修复人的脊椎呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put a human spine back together bone by bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.84,0:35:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多年的学习和练习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Study and practice. Years of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.28,0:35:53.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯特兰奇先生 - 叫我斯蒂芬就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Strange. - Stephen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.09,0:35:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那你是 - 王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you are? - Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.03,0:35:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.80,0:35:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就单一个王吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just Wong?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.19,0:36:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像 阿黛尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like... Adele?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.84,0:36:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者 亚里士多德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or... Aristotle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.28,0:36:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德雷克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.81,0:36:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bono.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.30,0:36:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eminem.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.17,0:36:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是《幻日之书》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Book of the Invisible Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是《新天文学》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Astronomia Nova.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.06,0:36:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是《统御法典》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Codex Imperium.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.09,0:36:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是《所罗门钥匙》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Key of Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.89,0:36:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你全都看完了吗 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You finished all of this? - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.34,0:36:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come with me. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.86,0:36:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个区域仅对法师开放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This section is for Masters only.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.75,0:36:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果有我的允许 其他人也可以看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at my discretion, others may use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.35,0:36:41.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从《马克西姆的启蒙》开始看吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should start with Maxim's Primer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.91,0:36:46.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的梵文怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's your Sanskrit?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.26,0:36:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我谷歌翻译用得挺溜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fluent in Google Translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吠陀 古典梵语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vedic, classical Sanskrit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.31,0:36:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古一法师的私人收藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ancient One's private collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.99,0:37:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以禁止阅览吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they're forbidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.79,0:37:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡马塔奇没有禁止阅览的知识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No knowledge in Kamar-Taj is forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.01,0:37:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有个别禁施的法术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only certain practices.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.67,0:37:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了至尊法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those books are far too advanced
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.46,0:37:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些书对其他人来说太过深奥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for anyone other than the Sorcerer Supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.08,0:37:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这本书有缺页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's got pages missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.21,0:37:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是《卡里奥斯特罗之书》 是研究时间的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Book of Cagliostro. A study of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.21,0:37:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个前法师偷走了一个法事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the rituals was stolen by a former Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.27,0:37:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个狂热信徒 叫卡西利亚斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The zealot, Kaecilius.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.32,0:37:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还把前任图书管理员吊了起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just after he strung up the former librarian,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.60,0:37:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并砍下了他的首级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and relieved him of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.20,0:37:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我来守卫这些书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am now the guardian of these books.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.61,0:37:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以如果再有一本藏书被偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if a volume from this collection should be stolen again,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.27,0:37:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都会知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.88,0:37:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不及离开这里就会没命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'd be dead before you ever left the compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.34,0:38:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那如果只是逾期了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it's just overdue? You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.98,0:38:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有什么逾期费吗 打个伤残什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any... late fees I should know about? Maiming, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.70,0:38:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗 以前大家都觉得我很幽默呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, people used to think that I was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.80,0:38:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是你的手下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.31,0:38:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 跟你谈话真愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Well, it's been lovely talking to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.40,0:38:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你给我找书 给我讲恐怖故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thank you for the books and for the horrifying story and
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.57,0:38:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并对我进行人身威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the threat upon my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.78,0:38:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们将得到力量消灭背叛我们的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will now receive the power to destroy the one who betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.99,0:39:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是背叛世界的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one who betrays the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.52,0:40:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掌握悬戒是学习魔法必不可少的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mastery of the sling ring is essential to the mystic arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.57,0:40:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悬戒让我们可以在多元宇宙中穿行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They allow us to travel throughout the multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.04,0:40:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所要做的就是集中精神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you need to do is focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.43,0:40:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visualize.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.21,0:40:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在脑海中勾勒出目的地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See the destination in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.67,0:40:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目光超越你面前的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look beyond the world in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.37,0:40:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想象出每个细节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine every detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.56,0:40:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画面越清晰 召唤传送门就会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clearer the picture, the quicker, and easier,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.15,0:40:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越快 越容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the gateway will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.38,0:40:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.95,0:40:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和斯特兰奇先生单独谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like a moment alone with Mr. Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.35,0:40:39.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.41,0:40:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都怪我的手 - 这和你的手无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My hands. - It's not about your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.84,0:40:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么会和我的手无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is this not about my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.17,0:40:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈密尔法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Hamir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.85,0:41:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有劳了 哈密尔法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Master Hamir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.55,0:41:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无法打得河流服从你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot beat a river into submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.80,0:41:11.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得顺应它的流势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to surrender to its current,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.81,0:41:13.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,化其力量为己用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and use its power as your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.78,0:41:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要放弃掌控 才能掌控它吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I control it by surrendering control?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.52,0:41:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那根本没道理啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.66,0:41:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并非凡事都有道理 也并非都必须有道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everything does. Not everything has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.24,0:41:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的智力引领了你的人生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your intellect has taken you far in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.85,0:41:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它不会让你更进一步了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it will take you no further.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.93,0:41:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺从吧 斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surrender, Stephen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.22,0:41:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下你的自负{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence your ego
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.52,0:41:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的力量才会显现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your power will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.05,0:41:34.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.61,0:41:42.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等等 这是不是... - 珠穆朗玛峰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. Is this... - Everest.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.30,0:41:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真美 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Beautiful. - Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.18,0:41:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很美 很冷 但...很美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful. Freezing, but... beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.65,0:41:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这种温度下 人只能存活30分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this temperature, a person can last for 30 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.26,0:41:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 然后就会永久丧失身体机能 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- before suffering permanent loss of function. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.79,0:42:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但前两分钟内你大概就会休克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll likely go into shock within the first 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.17,0:42:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.67,0:42:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 顺从吧 斯蒂芬 - 不不 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Surrender, Stephen. - No, no!!! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.16,0:42:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 新来的怎么样了 - 即将见分晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's our new recruit? - We shall see.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.19,0:42:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.01,0:42:24.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧 又来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.62,0:42:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我该...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I should...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.07,0:43:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯蒂芬 - 王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stephen. - Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.99,0:43:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要什么 斯特兰奇 - 魂体投射的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want, Strange? - Books on astral projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.65,0:43:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还没准备好 - 放马过来 碧昂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not ready for that. - Try me, Beyonce.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.92,0:44:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了 你听说过她吧 她可是大腕啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You've heard of her. She's a huge star, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.90,0:44:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你笑过吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you ever laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.42,0:44:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了 把书给我吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, just give me the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.78,0:44:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.32,0:44:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这个房间 你曾求我教你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once, in this room, you begged me to let you learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.98,0:44:43.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今我却听说 你质疑所有教导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm told you question every lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.28,0:44:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而更喜欢自学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}prefering to teach yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.96,0:44:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这个房间 你曾要我睁开眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once, in this room, you told me to open my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.12,0:44:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今我却听说 要盲目遵守毫无道理的规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm being told to blindly accept rules that make no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.91,0:44:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如不能在图书馆里开传送门吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the rule against conjuring a gateway in the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.05,0:44:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王打我小报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wong told on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.25,0:44:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的魔法法术进步很快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're advancing quickly with your sorcery skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.15,0:45:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要一个安全的地方练习咒语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a safe space to practice your spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.51,0:45:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在处于镜像次元中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are now inside the Mirror Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.80,0:45:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永恒存在但不会被发觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever present but undetected.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.19,0:45:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的事不会影响真实世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real world isn't affected by what happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.85,0:45:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在镜像次元中训练 监视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We use the Mirror Dimension to train, surveil,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.31,0:45:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会用它来控制威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sometimes to contain threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.75,0:45:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万不要没戴悬戒被困在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna be stuck in here without your sling ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.04,0:45:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 抱歉 你刚说的威胁是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. Sorry, what do you mean, threats?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.71,0:45:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解无穷的多元宇宙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learning of an infinite multiverse
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.53,0:45:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就也要了解无尽的危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}includes learning of infinite dangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.33,0:45:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我把所有你尚不知道的东西都告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I told you everything else that you don't already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.90,0:45:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只会仓皇逃跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd run from here in terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.55,0:46:07.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说 她究竟有多老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, just how ancient is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.33,0:46:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人知道至尊法师的年龄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one knows the age of the Sorcerer Supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.71,0:46:15.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只知道她是凯尔特人 从不提起往事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only that she is Celtic and never talks about her past.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.50,0:46:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不了解她还追随她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You follow her even though you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.57,0:46:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道她坚定不移 却又高深莫测{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that she's steadfast, but unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.67,0:46:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无情 却有仁爱之心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merciless, yet kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.54,0:46:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她成就了如今的我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She made me what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.13,0:46:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信你的导师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.51,0:46:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切勿迷失方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't lose your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.82,0:46:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 像卡西利亚斯那样吗 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like Kaecilius? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.41,0:46:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.24,0:46:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚来时 失去了所有挚爱之人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he first came to us, he'd lost everyone he ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.78,0:46:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他悲痛欲绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a grieving, broken man,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.57,0:46:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在魔法中寻找答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}searching for answers in the mystic arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.70,0:46:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个才华横溢的学生 但自傲又顽固{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A brilliant student, but he was proud, headstrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.65,0:46:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他质疑古一法师 排斥我们的教导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He questioned the Ancient One, rejected our teaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.45,0:47:02.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他离开了卡马塔奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left Kamar-Taj.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.33,0:47:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的门徒如羊群般跟随{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His disciples followed him like sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.12,0:47:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被伪教义迷惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seduced by false doctrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.09,0:47:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他偷了一个禁忌法事 对吗 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He stole the forbidden ritual, right? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.81,0:47:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是干什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再问问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.08,0:47:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 这也是问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - That's a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.24,0:47:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个法器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.25,0:47:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些魔法太过强大 无法维持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some magic is too powerful to sustain,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.15,0:47:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们唯有将其注入物件之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we imbue objects with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.46,0:47:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让它们去承受我们承受不了的负担{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allowing them to take the strain we can not.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.01,0:47:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.57,0:47:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是生命法庭权杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the Staff of the Living Tribunal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.42,0:47:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多法器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are many relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.17,0:47:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓦图姆魔杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Wand of Watoomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.49,0:47:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛多之靴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Vaulting Boots of Valtorr.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.78,0:47:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是朗朗上口 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really just roll off the tongue, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.83,0:47:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么时候能有自己的法器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do I get my relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.15,0:47:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等你准备好 - 我觉得我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When you're ready. - I think I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.21,0:47:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法器觉得你准备好了 你才算准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're ready when the relic decides you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.79,0:47:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.26,0:47:58.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变出一个武器来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}conjure a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.55,0:48:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.34,0:48:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.97,0:48:11.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像你命系于此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight like your life depended on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.13,0:48:19.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有一天 或许真会如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because one day, it may.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.81,0:48:42.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(克里斯汀)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.98,0:48:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(我再给你发一次邮件)
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.31,0:49:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wong?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.98,0:49:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.59,0:49:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 打开阿戈摩托之眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, open the Eye of Agamotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.22,0:50:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.93,0:50:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.50,0:50:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.83,0:51:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.93,0:51:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗次元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dark Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.21,0:51:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eternal life?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.80,0:51:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.10,0:51:27.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.96,0:51:33.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干涉时空连续性是大忌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tampering with continuum probabilitie is forbidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.14,0:51:35.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是...在照书上的指示操作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I wa... I was just doing exactly what it said in the book!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.82,0:51:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那进行法事的危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what did the book say
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.99,0:51:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,书上是怎么说的呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the dangers of performing that ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.67,0:51:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我还没看到那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I hadn't gotten to that part yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.44,0:51:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操纵时间会创建出时间分支{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Temporal manipulations can create branches in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.85,0:51:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不稳定的次元开口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unstable dimensional openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.36,0:51:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空间悖论 时间循环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spatial paradoxes! Time loops!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.67,0:51:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想被困在一遍遍重复的时间段里吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna get stuck reliving the same moment over, and over, forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.11,0:51:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是存在完全被抹去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or never having existed at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.67,0:51:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告真的应该放在咒语前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really should put the warnings before the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.01,0:51:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的好奇心可能会害死你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your curiosity could have gotten you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.12,0:52:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是在操纵时空连续性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't manipulating the space-time continuum,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.58,0:52:02.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是在破坏它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were breaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.81,0:52:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不打破自然法则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not tamper with natural law.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.40,0:52:07.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是保卫它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.14,0:52:08.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you even do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.98,0:52:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪学到的理解它所需要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you learn the litany of spells required
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.98,0:52:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冗长的咒语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to even understand it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.01,0:52:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我过目不忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a photographic memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.31,0:52:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才能同时拿到医学和哲学博士学位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I got my M.D. and Ph.D. at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.42,0:52:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚做到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you just did
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.78,0:52:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要的不仅是好记性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}takes more than a good memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.54,0:52:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是为魔法而生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were born for the mystic arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.29,0:52:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但我的手还在抖 - 暂时还在抖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And yet, my hands still shake. - For now, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.05,0:52:28.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不会永远如此吗 - 我们不是先知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not forever? - We're not prophets.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.45,0:52:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们什么时候才肯告诉我 我们是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you gonna start telling me what we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.81,0:52:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇者那样的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While heroes like the Avengers
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.32,0:52:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护世界免受实体伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}protect the world from physical dangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.13,0:52:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们法师捍卫世界 抵御魔法威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we sorcerers safeguard it against more mystical threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.60,0:52:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古一法师是最新一位继承了至尊法师头衔的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ancient One is the latest in a long line of Sorcerers Supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.82,0:52:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可追溯至千百年前的魔法鼻祖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going back thousands of years to the father of the mystic arts,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.32,0:52:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全能的阿戈摩托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the mighty Agamotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.50,0:52:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那个创造了被你鲁莽借用的魔眼法器的法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same sorcerer who created the eye you so recklessly borrowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.80,0:53:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿戈摩托在魔力强的地方造了三座圣殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agamotto built 3 Sanctums in places of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.61,0:53:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些地方如今都是大城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where great cities now stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.84,0:53:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那扇门通往香港圣殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That door leads to the Hong Kong Sanctum,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.79,0:53:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那扇通往纽约圣殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that door to the New York Sanctum.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.42,0:53:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那扇通往伦敦圣殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one, to the London Sanctum.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.53,0:53:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三座圣殿一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, the Sanctums
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.41,0:53:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生成了一面保护世界的盾牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}generate a protective shield around our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.89,0:53:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣殿保护世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sanctums protect the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.75,0:53:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们法师保护圣殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we sorcerers protect the Sanctums.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.13,0:53:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抵御什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.93,0:53:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他次元里威胁我们宇宙的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other-dimensional beings that threaten our universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.62,0:53:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Dormammu?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.39,0:53:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪知道的这个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you learn that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.22,0:53:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚在《卡里奥斯特罗之书》里读到的 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just read it in the book of Cagliostro. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.79,0:53:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆存在于黑暗次元中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu dwells in the Dark Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.43,0:53:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超越时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.37,0:53:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是宇宙征服者 世界摧毁者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the cosmic conquerer, the destroyer of worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.74,0:53:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有无尽力量和无限渴望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A being of infinite power and endless hunger,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.44,0:53:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要侵略所有宇宙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a quest to invade every universe
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.12,0:54:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把所有世界都纳入他的黑暗次元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bring all worlds into his Dark Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.75,0:54:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他最渴望地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he hungers for Earth most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.73,0:54:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西利亚斯偷的那几页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pages that Kaecilius stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.04,0:54:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一种联系多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ritual to contact Dormammu
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.72,0:54:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并从黑暗次元中汲取能量的法事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and draw power from the Dark Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.96,0:54:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.41,0:54:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.74,0:54:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我退出 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.17,0:54:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来治手的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to heal my hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.50,0:54:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是来打什么魔法战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to fight in some mystical war.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.58,0:54:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}London.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.63,0:54:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西利亚斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaecilius!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.27,0:54:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.50,0:54:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王 莫多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wong? Mordo?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.79,0:55:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(布里克街117A)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.27,0:55:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.74,0:56:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.59,0:56:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹尼尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.96,0:56:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们任命你为这座圣殿的法师了啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see they made you Master of this Sanctum.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.16,0:56:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那意味着什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.70,0:56:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会为保护它而死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you'll die protecting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.71,0:57:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.97,0:57:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到卡马塔奇多久了 你叫...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been at Kamar-Taj, Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.68,0:57:29.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.32,0:57:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 博士先生 - 我姓斯特兰奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr Doctor? - It's Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.87,0:57:36.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.59,0:57:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这又不由我来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I to judge?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.62,1:00:05.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道怎么用 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know how to use that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.88,1:01:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.11,1:01:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.76,1:01:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫你别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.55,1:02:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你阻止不了它的 博士先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot stop this, Mr. Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.06,1:02:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我都不知道"它"是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why... look, I don't even know what "This" is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.01,1:02:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它既是开始也是结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the end and the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.18,1:02:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多数人变成少数人 变成唯一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The many becoming the few, becoming the One.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.58,1:02:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是不想说明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you're not gonna start making sense,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.00,1:02:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就再给你戴上它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just gonna have to put this thing back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.86,1:02:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我 博士先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Mr. Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.01,1:02:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我叫斯蒂芬·斯特兰奇博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, look. My name is Dr. Stephen Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.63,1:02:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是博士 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are a doctor? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.34,1:02:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A scientist.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.08,1:02:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂自然规律{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand the laws of nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.81,1:02:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切事物都会变老死去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All things age. All things die.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.24,1:02:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终 太阳将燃尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the end, our sun burns out,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.69,1:02:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的宇宙将变冷毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our universe grows cold and perishes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.61,1:02:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但黑暗次元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the Dark Dimension...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.17,1:02:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个地方超越了时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a place beyond time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.91,1:02:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了 我再给你戴上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. I'm putting this thing back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.54,1:02:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界不非得灭亡 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This world doesn't have to die, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.28,1:02:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界有权和其他很多世界一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This world can take its rightful place alongside so many others,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.10,1:02:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为唯一的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as part of the One.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.96,1:02:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伟大而美丽的唯一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The great and beautiful One.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.56,1:02:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都能永生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we can all live forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.57,1:02:50.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.06,1:02:56.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个新时代乌托邦次元对你有什么好处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you have to gain out of this New Age dimensional utopia?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.19,1:02:59.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你 跟所有人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same as you. The same as everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.22,1:03:01.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命 永恒的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life. Eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.88,1:03:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们总是从善恶角度思考{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People think in terms of good and evil,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.39,1:03:05.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实时间才是所有人真正的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when really, time is the true enemy of us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.73,1:03:07.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间会杀死一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time kills everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.78,1:03:09.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你杀死的人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the people you killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.65,1:03:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那都只是微小 转瞬即逝的尘埃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiny, momentary specks
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.87,1:03:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂浮在这冷漠的世界里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}within an indifferent universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.33,1:03:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 你明白了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. You see,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.12,1:03:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白我们在做什么了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you see what we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.78,1:03:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世界不是它应该有的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is not what it ought to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.32,1:03:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类渴望永恒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humanity longs for the eternal,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.23,1:03:27.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渴望超越时间的世界 因为时间奴役我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a world beyond time, because time is what enslaves us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.65,1:03:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间是一种侮辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is an insult.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡是一种侮辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death is an insult.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.41,1:03:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.50,1:03:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不求统治世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't seek to rule this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.04,1:03:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们求的是拯救它 把它交给多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We seek to save it, to hand it over to Dormammu,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.48,1:03:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他才是一切进化的目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who is the intent of all evolution,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.95,1:03:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才是一切生命存在的缘由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Why of all existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.78,1:03:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至尊法师保卫生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sorcerer Supreme defends existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.09,1:03:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么让你前往卡马塔奇 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it that brought you to Kamar-Taj, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.33,1:03:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是教化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it enlightenment?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.78,1:03:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.77,1:04:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是想去被治愈 我们都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came to be healed, as did we all.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.93,1:04:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡马塔奇吸纳了各种残破的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kamar-Taj is a place that collects broken things.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.72,1:04:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都是为治愈的希望而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all come with the promise of being healed,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.45,1:04:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但结果 古一只教我们些雕虫小技{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and instead, the Ancient One gives us parlor tricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.95,1:04:13.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的魔法被她据为己有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real magic she keeps for herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.53,1:04:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就没想过她是怎么活得这么久的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever wondered how she managed to live this long?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.19,1:04:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在《卡里奥斯特罗之书》中看到了那些法事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the rituals in the book of Cagliostro.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.72,1:04:27.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.22,1:04:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法事给了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ritual gives me the power
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.75,1:04:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒古一 拆毁圣殿的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to overthrow the Ancient One and tear her Sanctums down,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.20,1:04:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让黑暗次元进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to let the Dark Dimension in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.03,1:04:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为古一私藏的 多玛姆会无私给予{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because what the Ancient One hoards, Dormammu gives freely.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.62,1:04:42.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命 永生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life, everlasting.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.90,1:04:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是世界的毁灭者 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is not the destroyer of worlds, Doctor,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.19,1:04:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是世界的拯救者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he is the savior of worlds.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.15,1:04:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 拜托 看看你的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I mean, come on. Look at your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.59,1:04:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆把你变成了凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu made you a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.89,1:04:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的王国又能好到哪去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just how good can his kingdom be?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.20,1:04:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think that's funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.14,1:05:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是因为那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.99,1:05:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的是 你的悬戒丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's funny is that you've lost your sling ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.66,1:06:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 要帮忙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.74,1:06:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕尔默医生 她在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Palmer, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.18,1:06:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 先生 我们得... - 她在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, we need to get... - Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.76,1:06:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在护士站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nurses station.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.38,1:06:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯汀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christine!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.54,1:06:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stephen?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.80,1:06:23.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 怎么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my god. What...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.73,1:06:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得马上带我找个手术室 就你一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get me in an operating theater now. Just you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.53,1:06:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 我没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now! I haven't any time!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 被刺了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - I was stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.69,1:06:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心脏填塞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cardiac tamponade.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.34,1:06:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿的是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.47,1:06:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胸腔没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chest cavity is clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.25,1:06:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 血液 积在围心囊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the blood... is in the pericardial sac.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.16,1:06:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No no no no no no no!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.84,1:06:50.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯蒂芬 斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stephen! Stephen!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.26,1:06:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撑住 撑住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.31,1:07:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再往上一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a little higher.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.55,1:07:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心针头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please be careful with the needle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.11,1:07:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stephen?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.00,1:07:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 我的魂体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What am I seeing? - My astral body.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.10,1:07:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.32,1:07:37.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 克里斯汀 但我要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Christine, but I am dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.14,1:07:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.62,1:07:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.61,1:07:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.21,1:07:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样的伤口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen a wound like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.67,1:07:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被什么刺伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you stabbed with?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.58,1:08:00.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.78,1:08:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我现在得消失了 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna have to vanish now. - No, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.75,1:08:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让我死 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep me alive, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.48,1:08:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.80,1:08:30.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.88,1:08:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.01,1:09:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(充电至200焦)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.69,1:09:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.93,1:09:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯蒂芬 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stephen, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.77,1:09:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再电我一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit me again!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.81,1:09:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop doing that!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.06,1:09:48.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提高电压 再电我一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up the voltage and hit me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.65,1:09:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 你的心脏跳了 - 照做吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, your heart is beating! - Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.06,1:09:54.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.50,1:10:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(充电至360焦)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.30,1:10:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(不要碰触病人 按电击键)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.74,1:10:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh god! Oh god!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.94,1:10:26.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you ok? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.21,1:10:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.91,1:10:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了这么久 你突然出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all this time, you just show up here,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.54,1:10:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魂体飞出身体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}flying out of your body?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.74,1:10:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.62,1:10:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you too, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.27,1:10:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你发了邮件 你从来不回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wrote you emails, but you never responded.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.87,1:10:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.27,1:10:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯汀 我太抱歉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christine, I am so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.55,1:10:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为一切道歉 你说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For all of it. I mean, you were right,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.85,1:11:02.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个彻头彻尾的混蛋 我对你太不好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a complete asshole. I treated you so horribly
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.09,1:11:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应得到更好的对待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you deserved so much more.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.34,1:11:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了 你显然是受惊了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. You... you're clearly in shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.03,1:11:09.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.62,1:11:11.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.65,1:11:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西药没能治好我后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, after Western medicine failed me,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.73,1:11:19.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了东方 最终来到加德满都{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I headed East, and I ended up in Kathmandu.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.22,1:11:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 加德满都 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kathmandu? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.43,1:11:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍勃·西格歌里唱的那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, like the Bob Seger song?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.76,1:11:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1975年的《美丽失意者》A面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1975, Beautiful Loser, side A. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.33,1:11:28.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我去了一个叫卡马塔奇的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, I went to a place called Kamar-Taj
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.49,1:11:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟一位叫古一法师的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I talked to someone
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.12,1:11:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聊了聊 然后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called the Ancient One, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.87,1:11:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以你加入了邪教 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you joined a cult. - No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.75,1:11:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不算是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly. No. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.57,1:11:40.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们确实教我挖掘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they did teach me to tap into powers
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.01,1:11:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前闻所未闻的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I never even knew existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.56,1:11:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听起来就像是邪教 - 不是邪教{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, that sounds like a cult. - It's not a cult.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.00,1:11:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 邪教徒就会这么说 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, that's what a cultist would say. - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.08,1:11:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Stephen, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.01,1:11:50.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.07,1:11:51.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪教集会我要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm late for a cult meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.71,1:11:57.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 简直是疯了 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is insane. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.04,1:11:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.70,1:12:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能跟我说实话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.98,1:12:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一位强大的魔法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a powerful sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.60,1:12:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把自己献给了一个远古实体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who gave himself over to an ancient entity
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.26,1:12:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能打破物理法则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can bend the very laws of physics,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.63,1:12:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还拼命想杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tried very hard to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.04,1:12:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我把他铐在格林尼治村了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I left him chained up in Greenwich Village,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.80,1:12:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到那个地方最快的办法是走传送门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the quickest way back there is through a dimensional gateway
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.07,1:12:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在清洁间开了一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I opened up in the mop closet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.49,1:12:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 不说算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Don't tell me. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.22,1:12:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really do have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.58,1:13:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.43,1:13:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.91,1:13:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相对而言 是的 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A relative term, but yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.94,1:13:26.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悬浮斗篷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cloak of Levitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.59,1:13:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它找上你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.74,1:13:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No minor feat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.25,1:13:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可花心了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a fickle thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.79,1:13:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.15,1:13:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡西利亚斯 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kaecilius? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.64,1:13:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能随意折叠空间和物质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can fold space and matter at will.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.29,1:13:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能在镜像次元外折叠物质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He folds matter outside the mirror dimension?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.77,1:13:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在真实世界中 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In the real world? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.91,1:13:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有几个 - 两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many more? - Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.83,1:13:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把一个丢在了沙漠里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stranded one in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.19,1:13:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 另一个呢 - 他的尸体就在大厅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the other? - His body's in the hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.77,1:13:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多拉姆法师在门厅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Drumm is in the foyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.76,1:13:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被带回卡马塔奇了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been taken back to Kamar-Taj.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.49,1:13:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦圣殿沦陷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The London Sanctum has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.12,1:14:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下纽约和香港的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only New York and Hong Kong remain now
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.38,1:14:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来抵御黑暗次元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to shield us from the Dark Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.48,1:14:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你保卫了遭受袭击的纽约圣殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You defended the New York Sanctum from attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.40,1:14:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的法师走了 需要一位新的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With its Master gone, it needs another,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.57,1:14:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.93,1:14:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.08,1:14:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是斯特兰奇博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Dr. Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.94,1:14:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是斯特兰奇法师或斯特兰奇先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Master Strange, not Mr. Strange,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.88,1:14:22.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是斯特兰奇博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.52,1:14:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我成为医生时 曾发誓不伤害他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I became a doctor, I swore an oath to do no harm.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.08,1:14:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我刚刚就杀了一个人 我不会做第二次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have just killed a man! I'm not doing that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.48,1:14:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当医生是为了救人而非杀人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I became a doctor to save lives, not take them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.92,1:14:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当医生主要是为了救一条生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You become a doctor to save one life above all others.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.83,1:14:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.82,1:14:40.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是能看穿我 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still seeing through me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.62,1:14:42.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到的是我一直所见的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see what I've always seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.71,1:14:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你过于膨胀的自我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your overinflated ego.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.10,1:14:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想回到之前 你能够掌控一切的妄想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to go back to the delusion that you can control anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.44,1:14:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至掌控死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even death,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.07,1:14:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而没人能控制死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which no one can control.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.79,1:14:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伟大的斯蒂芬·斯特兰奇博士也不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even the great doctor Stephen Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.74,1:14:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆也不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even Dormammu?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.19,1:14:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能让人永生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He offers immortality.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.76,1:15:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是我们对死亡的恐惧给了多玛姆生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our fear of death that gives Dormammu life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.50,1:15:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他以此为食 - 正如你以他为食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He feeds off it. - Like you feed on him?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.39,1:15:07.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我说掌控死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk to me about controlling death.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.89,1:15:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是怎么做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I know how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.00,1:15:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看过了《卡里奥斯特罗之书》里缺失的法事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen the missing rituals from the book of Cagliostro.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.27,1:15:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万当心你接下来要说的话 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Measure your next words very carefully, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.48,1:15:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你可能不喜欢听吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you might not like them?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.33,1:15:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你可能不知道你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you may not know of what you speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.37,1:15:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在说什么 - 我在说她的长命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is he talking about? - I'm talking about her long life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.27,1:15:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不死的缘由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The source of her immortality.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.93,1:15:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她从黑暗次元汲取能量来维持生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She draws power from the Dark Dimension to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.41,1:15:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.74,1:15:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见过那些法事 想明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen the rituals, worked them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.89,1:15:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是怎么做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.80,1:15:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他们重组 狂热信徒就会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once they regroup, the zealots will be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.70,1:15:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们会需要支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.09,1:15:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是你以为的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is not who you think she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.76,1:15:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没资格那么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have the right to say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.01,1:16:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道她肩上担负的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've no idea the responsibility that rests upon her shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.47,1:16:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我也不想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, and I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.00,1:16:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是个懦夫 - 因为我不是个杀手吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're a coward. - Because I'm not a killer?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.25,1:16:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狂热信徒会把我们统统消灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These zealots will snuff us all out,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.12,1:16:09.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你却不能振作起来 先消灭他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you can't muster the strength to snuff them first?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.72,1:16:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你以为我刚刚做了什么 - 你救了你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think I just did? - You saved your own life!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.93,1:16:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后像只受伤的狗一样不停抱怨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then whined about it like a wounded dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.59,1:16:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你就能轻松做到吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would have done it so easily?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.99,1:16:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无法想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've no idea,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.83,1:16:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做过的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the things I've done...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.61,1:16:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案是没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the answer is yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.07,1:16:28.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 毫不犹豫 - 即使还有别的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Without hesitation. - Even if there's another way?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.02,1:16:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有别的办法 - 是你缺乏想象力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is no other way. - You lack imagination.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.43,1:16:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 斯蒂芬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Stephen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.01,1:16:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你缺少骨气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lack a spine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.55,1:16:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.46,1:16:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得了结此事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to end this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.97,1:16:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.42,1:17:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇 下来战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange! Get down here and fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.85,1:17:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.23,1:17:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜像次元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mirror Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.21,1:17:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里无法影响真实世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't affect the real world in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.09,1:17:13.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是谁得意呢 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's laughing now, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.02,1:17:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.54,1:17:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿了他的悬戒 他们跑不了的 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got his sling ring. I mean, they can't escape, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.13,1:17:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.64,1:17:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们与黑暗次元的联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their connection to the Dark Dimension
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.00,1:17:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使他们在镜像次元里更为强大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes them more powerful in the Mirror Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.31,1:17:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不能影响真实世界 但还是能杀了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't affect the real world, but they can still kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.63,1:17:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这并不明智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This wasn't cleverness.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.62,1:18:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was suicide!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.23,1:18:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.59,1:19:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.71,1:20:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.80,1:20:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真的从黑暗次元汲取能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She does draw power from the Dark Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.77,1:20:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西利亚斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaecilius.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.64,1:20:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我投奔你时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.81,1:20:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}broken,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.69,1:20:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lost,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.01,1:20:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in need.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.89,1:21:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我信任你做我的导师 你却满口谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trusted you to be my teacher, and you fed me lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.76,1:21:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是想保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.41,1:21:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真相会伤害我吗 - 你自己会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- From the truth? - From yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.85,1:21:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今我有新导师了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a new teacher now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.98,1:21:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆在欺骗你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu deceives you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.67,1:21:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道他的真面目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what he truly is.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.23,1:21:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他所谓的永生并非天堂 而是无尽的煎熬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His eternal life is not paradise, but torment.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.13,1:21:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.52,1:22:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯汀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christine!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.13,1:22:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.32,1:22:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.41,1:22:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是心房颤动 她心肌顿抑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not fibrillation. She has a stunned myocardium.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.55,1:22:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 神经性休克吗 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Neurogenic? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.86,1:22:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿棉签{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone get the swabs.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.18,1:22:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nic?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.84,1:22:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得降低她的脑压{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to relieve the pressure on her brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.96,1:22:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她心率在下降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's still dropping.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.50,1:22:47.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她快不行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're losing her!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.45,1:22:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得给她加氧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to increase her oxygen!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.72,1:22:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 急救车推过来 - 她的瞳孔放大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need a crash cart! - Her pupils have dilated!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无反射能力 也读不到脑部活动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No reflexes. We're not reading any brain activity.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.18,1:23:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.61,1:23:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 你快死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You're dying!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.11,1:23:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得马上回到身体里 你没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to return to your body now. You don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.52,1:23:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间是相对的 你的身体还没倒地呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is relative. Your body hasn't even hit the floor yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.61,1:23:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我花了太多岁月窥视未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spent so many years peering through time,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.49,1:23:33.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}looking at this exact moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.82,1:23:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却看不到之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can't see past it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.21,1:23:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我阻止了无数种可怕的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've prevented countless terrible futures.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.80,1:23:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一次接着一次 永无休止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after each one, there's always another.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.51,1:23:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都将我带到这一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they all lead here,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.99,1:23:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也止于这一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but never further.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.93,1:23:47.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得自己死于这一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think this is where you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.14,1:23:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道我在你的未来看到什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wonder what I see in your future?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.66,1:23:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.61,1:23:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.17,1:23:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未看到过你的未来 只能看到其可能性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never saw your future. Only its possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.43,1:24:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有行大善的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have such a capacity for goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.36,1:24:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是很出众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always excelled,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.27,1:24:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但并非因为你渴望成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not because you crave success,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.89,1:24:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是因为你害怕失败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but because of your fear of failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.41,1:24:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因此我才是一位优秀的医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what made me a great doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.43,1:24:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因此你无法成就伟业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's precisely what kept you from greatness.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.11,1:24:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傲慢和恐惧仍绊着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrogance and fear still keep you
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.28,1:24:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你无法学会最简单也最重要的一课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from learning the simplest and most significant lesson of all.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.90,1:24:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.05,1:24:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你并不重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.09,1:24:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你第一次来找我时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you first came to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.21,1:24:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问我是如何治愈了乔纳森·潘伯恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you asked me how I was able to heal Jonathan Pangborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.64,1:24:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.80,1:24:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他将次元能量引入体内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He channels dimensional energy directly into his own body.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.11,1:24:47.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他靠魔法行走 - 时刻如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He uses magic to walk. - Constantly.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.85,1:24:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可以选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a choice,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.47,1:24:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是回到原来的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to return to his own life
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.96,1:24:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是为比小我更伟大的事业做贡献{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or to serve something greater than himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.18,1:24:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我的手能复原吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I could have my hands back again?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.12,1:24:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能回到从前的生活吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My old life?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.28,1:25:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.51,1:25:05.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而世界会因此变得更加危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the world would be all the lesser for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.92,1:25:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我厌恶从黑暗次元汲取能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've hated drawing power from the Dark Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.28,1:25:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as you well know,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.37,1:25:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人有时必须打破规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes one must break the rules
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.87,1:25:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能够成就伟大的事业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to serve the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.76,1:25:17.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫多不会这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mordo won't see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.00,1:25:20.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫多的灵魂刚强不屈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mordo's soul is rigid and unmovable,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.52,1:25:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他青春的火焰锻造的品性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forged by the fires of his youth.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.25,1:25:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他需要你的变通 就像你需要他的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs your flexibility, just as you need his strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.20,1:25:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只有共同努力 才有希望阻止多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only together do you stand a chance of stopping Dormammu.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.23,1:25:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.76,1:25:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one ever is.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.81,1:25:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时机由不得我们选{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't get to choose our time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.13,1:25:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是死亡赋予了生命意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death is what gives life meaning.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.54,1:25:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道自己生命有限{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To know your days are numbered,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.17,1:25:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生苦短{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your time is short.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.10,1:25:57.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按说都这么久了 我应该准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd think after all this time I'd be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.42,1:25:59.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你看看我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But look at me,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.12,1:26:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无限延长片刻时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stretching one moment out into a thousand,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.37,1:26:05.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就为了看雪景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just so that I can watch the snow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.56,1:26:45.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.81,1:26:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不明白是怎么回事 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't understand what's happening. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.92,1:27:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have to go away now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.74,1:27:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾说失去我的手未必是末路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that losing my hands didn't have to be the end,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.45,1:27:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可以是开端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it could be a beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.52,1:27:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.17,1:27:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为还有其他方式可以拯救生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there are other ways to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.97,1:27:20.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更艰难的方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A harder way.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.83,1:27:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更怪异的方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A weirder way.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.89,1:27:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕尔默医生 请前往急诊室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Palmer, to the ER, please. Dr. Palmer, to the ER.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.95,1:27:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望你走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.93,1:28:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.28,1:28:32.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(香港)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.99,1:28:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好选择武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choose your weapon wisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.22,1:29:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都别想闯进圣殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one steps foot in this Sanctum.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.75,1:29:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.73,1:29:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西利亚斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaecilius.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.31,1:29:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你站错了队 王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on the wrong side of history, Wong.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.16,1:29:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她死了 - 你是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's dead. - You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.22,1:29:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她并不是我以为的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wasn't who I thought she was.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.17,1:29:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很复杂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.79,1:29:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复杂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Complicated?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.57,1:29:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗次元不稳定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dark Dimension is volatile.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.91,1:29:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.04,1:30:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她被控制了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it overtook her?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.23,1:30:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她教导我们那是禁忌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She taught us it was forbidden,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.39,1:30:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她自己却汲取其能量 来盗取数世纪的寿命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while she drew on its power to steal centuries of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.16,1:30:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她做了她以为正确的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did what she thought was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.36,1:30:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代价终究会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bill comes due.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.13,1:30:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.93,1:30:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的犯忌导致狂热信徒投向多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her transgressions led the zealots to Dormammu.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.13,1:30:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西利亚斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaecilius
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.60,1:30:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was her fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.68,1:30:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们现在 就在面对她欺瞒的后果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here we are, in the consequence of her deception.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.52,1:30:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浴火的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.80,1:30:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫多 伦敦圣殿已经沦陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mordo,London Sanctum has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.45,1:30:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约圣殿也两次遭到袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The New York one has been attacked. Twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.36,1:30:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你清楚他们接下来要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where they're going next.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.82,1:30:41.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,香港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.74,1:30:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾叫我战斗 就好像我命系于此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me once to fight like my life depended on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.19,1:30:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有一天 或许真会如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because one day, it might.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.36,1:30:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天已经到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, today is that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.46,1:30:49.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能一个人打败他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot defeat them alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.44,1:31:09.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣殿已经沦陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sanctum's already fallen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.85,1:31:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗次元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dark Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.35,1:31:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.33,1:31:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.92,1:31:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么能阻止他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.49,1:31:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未必{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.19,1:31:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.73,1:32:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咒语起效了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spell's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.64,1:32:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有第二次机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.50,1:34:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.26,1:34:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wong!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.34,1:34:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打破自然法则 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breaking the laws of nature, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.31,1:34:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别现在停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, don't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.52,1:34:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等圣殿复原{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the Sanctum is restored,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.00,1:34:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会再次发起攻击 我们得守住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll attack it again. We've gotta defend it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.08,1:34:34.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.96,1:35:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来 斯特兰奇 起来战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, Strange. Get up and fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.17,1:35:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以做个了结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.70,1:35:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无法抵抗不可避免之事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't fight the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.05,1:35:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多美啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.38,1:35:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超越时间的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world beyond time.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.37,1:35:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超越死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond death.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.81,1:35:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超越时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond time...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.64,1:35:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.34,1:36:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.92,1:36:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连斯特兰奇也抛下你们 屈服于他的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Strange has left you and surrendered to his power.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.11,1:36:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆 我来谈条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu! I've come to bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.77,1:36:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是来受死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've come to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.28,1:36:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的世界现在是我的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your world is now my world,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.92,1:36:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像所有世界一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like all worlds.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.05,1:37:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆 我来谈条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu! I've come to bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.58,1:37:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是来受死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've come to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.81,1:37:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的世界现在是我的了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your world is now my...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.64,1:37:37.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.92,1:37:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻觉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Illusion?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.33,1:37:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 是真的 - 那就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, this is real. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.53,1:37:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆 我来谈条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu! I've come to bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.11,1:37:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've... what is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.59,1:38:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你给卡西利亚斯你的次元的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just as you gave Kaecilius powers from your dimension,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.35,1:38:04.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也从我的世界带来了一份力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought a little power from mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.39,1:38:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is time.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.07,1:38:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无尽循环的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Endless looped time.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.86,1:38:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好大胆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.43,1:38:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fu...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.33,1:38:19.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆 我来谈条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu! I've come to bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.45,1:38:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能永远这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot do this forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.23,1:38:24.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实 我能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.00,1:38:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就这样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how things are now.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.41,1:38:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我 困在这一刻里 无穷无尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me, trapped in this moment, endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.87,1:38:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就永生永世地死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you will spend eternity dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.72,1:38:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 但地球上的人都能得以存活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. But everyone on Earth will live.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.27,1:38:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你会受尽折磨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.82,1:38:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛苦跟我很熟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pain's an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.19,1:38:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.68,1:38:50.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来谈条件 - 停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've come to bargain. - End this!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.66,1:38:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.33,1:38:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.11,1:38:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多玛姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dormammu!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.32,1:39:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远不会赢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never win.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.57,1:39:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.48,1:39:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我可以输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.71,1:39:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.36,1:39:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and again,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.12,1:39:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无穷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and again,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.87,1:39:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无尽 直到永远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and again, forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.47,1:39:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那样你就是我的囚徒 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And that makes you my prisoner. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.73,1:39:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.11,1:39:33.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make this stop!!!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.05,1:39:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set me free!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.93,1:39:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.58,1:39:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来谈条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.09,1:39:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.24,1:39:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的狂热信徒从地球上带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your zealots from the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.00,1:39:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束你对我的世界的袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End your assault on my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.50,1:39:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远别回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.84,1:39:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照做 我就结束循环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, and I'll break the loop.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.85,1:40:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来 斯特兰奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.22,1:40:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up and fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.08,1:40:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以做个了结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.27,1:40:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多美啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.59,1:40:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超越时间的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world beyond time.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.59,1:40:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超越死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond death.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.98,1:40:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么 - 我谈妥了条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What have you done? - I made a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.28,1:40:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.08,1:40:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.99,1:40:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's everything you've ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.84,1:40:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永生 成为唯一的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eternal life as part of the One.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.83,1:40:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.54,1:41:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真该把整本书偷走的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you really should have stolen the whole book,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.67,1:41:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为警告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the warnings...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.91,1:41:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告是写在咒语后面的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the warnings come after the spells.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.37,1:41:30.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.84,1:41:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.89,1:42:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.79,1:42:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.54,1:42:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是靠违反自然法则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By also violating the natural laws.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.67,1:42:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你周围 都结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around you. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.36,1:42:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是觉得不会产生后果吗 斯特兰奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still think there will be no consequences, Strange?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.77,1:42:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No price to pay?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.94,1:42:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们跟她一样 打破了法则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We broke our rules, just like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.88,1:42:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代价终究会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bill comes due.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.44,1:42:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总会来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.43,1:42:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有清算的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A reckoning.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.73,1:42:37.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会再走这条路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will follow this path no longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.45,1:43:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.21,1:43:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明智之举{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wise choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.35,1:43:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今后还会有机会戴阿戈摩托之眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll wear the eye of Agamotto
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.37,1:43:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你掌握其法力之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once you've mastered its powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.79,1:43:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until then,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.00,1:43:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好别戴着无限宝石满街乱跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}best not to walk the streets wearing an infinity stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.01,1:43:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A what?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.17,1:43:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你或许有魔法天赋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might have a gift for the mystic arts,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.01,1:43:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你还有很多要学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you still have much to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.61,1:43:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古一法师的死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word of the Ancient One's death
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.10,1:43:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快将在多元宇宙里传开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will spread through the multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.45,1:43:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球没有至尊法师维护了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth has no Sorcerer Supreme to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.59,1:43:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们必须做好准备 - 我们会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We must be ready. - We'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.19,1:46:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《奇异博士》
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.23,1:46:35.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.39,1:46:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上现在还有魔法师了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Earth has wizards now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.51,1:46:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝茶吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tea?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.14,1:46:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喝茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't drink tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.61,1:46:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喝什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.85,1:46:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喝茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.55,1:46:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一份关注名单 都是来自{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I keep a watchlist of individuals and beings
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.60,1:46:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他世界 可能对这个世界构成威胁的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from other realms that may be a threat to this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.25,1:47:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的领养弟弟 洛基 就是其中之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your adopted brother, Loki, is one of those beings.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.08,1:47:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 的确该加上他 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Worthy inclusion. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.13,1:47:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么带他来纽约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why bring him here to New York?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.58,1:47:13.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这说来话长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bit of a long story.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.84,1:47:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家庭闹剧 之类的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family drama, that kind of thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.00,1:47:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在找我父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're looking for my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.29,1:47:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你们找到了奥丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, okay. So, if you found Odin,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.87,1:47:24.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都会马上回阿斯加德吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd all return to Asgard, promptly?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.74,1:47:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 马上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. Promptly.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.19,1:47:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.00,1:47:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me to help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.74,1:53:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.09,1:53:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们拿担架把你抬去了卡马塔奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They carried you into Kamar-Taj on a strecher.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.46,1:53:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你现在的样子 潘伯恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you now. Pangborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.05,1:53:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mordo.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.99,1:53:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能为你做什么 哥们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what can I do for you, Man?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.82,1:53:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我离开了数月 想通了一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been away for many months now and I've had a revelation.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.56,1:53:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法师的真正意图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The true purpose of a sorcerer
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.26,1:53:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是扭曲事物应有的形态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to twist things out of there proper shape.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.95,1:54:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盗取能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stealing power,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.32,1:54:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,败坏自然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}perverting nature...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.48,1:54:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.69,1:54:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没偷什么 这是我的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've stolen nothing. This is my power.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.91,1:54:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.78,1:54:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.06,1:54:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有目的的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.72,1:54:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.95,1:54:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我终于明白这世界的问题出在哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I see at long last what's wrong with the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.52,1:54:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有太多魔法师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too many sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.81,1:54:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇异博士还将回归
